<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CNF Transportation lifted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CNF Transportation lifted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co Inc said Tuesday it had raised its long-term rating on CNF Transportation Co to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- It reduced its Q1 earnings estimate on the company to a range of $0.30 to $0.35 a share from $0.40, noting that flooding and storms hurt CNF's performance.</p>
<p>-- It lifted its full-year 1997 EPS forecast to $1.80 from $1.75.</p>
<p>-- CNF was trading up 1/8 at 24-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
